        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n    %% Define Styling and Colors\n    classDef user fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#666666,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef acq fill:#f8cecc,stroke:#b85450,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef monitors fill:#dae8fc,stroke:#6c8ebf,stroke-width:1px;\n    classDef context fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef decision fill:#d5e8d4,stroke:#82b366,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef selectors fill:#e1d5e7,stroke:#9673a6,stroke-width:1px;\n    classDef exec fill:#ffe6cc,stroke:#d79b00,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef engine fill:#dfd,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;\n\n    %% Elements\n    User[USER]:::user\n    \n    subgraph Input_Extraction [\&quot;Input &amp; Extraction Layer\&quot;]\n        A[\&quot;Input Acquisition Layer&lt;br&gt;• Local Video&lt;br&gt;• YouTube URL&lt;br&gt;• Live Stream\&quot;]:::acq\n        B[\&quot;Video Decoding &amp;&lt;br&gt;Frame Extraction\&quot;]:::acq\n    end\n\n    subgraph Monitoring [\&quot;Context Monitoring Layer\&quot;]\n        C[\&quot;Network Monitor&lt;br&gt;• Bandwidth&lt;br&gt;• Latency&lt;br&gt;• Packet Loss&lt;br&gt;• Download Speed&lt;br&gt;• Upload Speed&lt;br&gt;• Video Bitrate\&quot;]:::monitors\n        D[\&quot;Device Monitor&lt;br&gt;• CPU Usage&lt;br&gt;• GPU Usage&lt;br&gt;• RAM Usage&lt;br&gt;• Battery Level&lt;br&gt;• Charging State&lt;br&gt;• Temperature\&quot;]:::monitors\n        E[\&quot;Scene Analyzer&lt;br&gt;• Motion&lt;br&gt;• Blur Score&lt;br&gt;• Texture Score&lt;br&gt;• Edge Density&lt;br&gt;• Scene Complexity&lt;br&gt;• Semantic Content\&quot;]:::monitors\n    end\n\n    F[\&quot;Context Feature Generator&lt;br&gt;Combines all extracted features into&lt;br&gt;a unified Context Feature Vector\&quot;]:::context\n    G[\&quot;Adaptive Decision Engine&lt;br&gt;• Multi-Criteria Decision Making&lt;br&gt;• Resource Optimization&lt;br&gt;• QoE Optimization&lt;br&gt;• Execution Scheduling\&quot;]:::decision\n\n    subgraph Selection [\&quot;Selection Options\&quot;]\n        H[\&quot;Input Quality Selection&lt;br&gt;• 480p&lt;br&gt;• 720p&lt;br&gt;• 1080p&lt;br&gt;• 4K\&quot;]:::selectors\n        I[\&quot;Execution Policy&lt;br&gt;• Local Execution&lt;br&gt;• Edge Execution&lt;br&gt;• Cloud Execution&lt;br&gt;• Hybrid Execution\&quot;]:::selectors\n        J[\&quot;Model Selection&lt;br&gt;• TinySR&lt;br&gt;• FSRCNN&lt;br&gt;• BasicVSR++&lt;br&gt;• RealBasicVSR&lt;br&gt;• Real-ESRGAN\&quot;]:::selectors\n    end\n\n    K[\&quot;Execution Scheduler\&quot;]:::exec\n\n    subgraph Execution_Engines [\&quot;Execution Engines\&quot;]\n        L[\&quot;Local Execution Engine&lt;br&gt;• Uses Device CPU / GPU&lt;br&gt;• ONNX / CUDA\&quot;]:::exec\n        M[\&quot;Edge / Cloud Execution&lt;br&gt;• GPU Cluster&lt;br&gt;• Docker Containers&lt;br&gt;• Resource Pool\&quot;]:::exec\n    end\n\n    N[\&quot;Video Super Resolution Engine\&quot;]:::engine\n    O[\&quot;Reconstruction &amp; Post-processing&lt;br&gt;• Frame Fusion&lt;br&gt;• Temporal Smoothing&lt;br&gt;• Video Encoding\&quot;]:::engine\n    P[Enhanced Output Video]:::decision\n\n    %% Connections\n    User --&gt; A\n    A --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; C\n    B --&gt; D\n    B --&gt; E\n\n    C --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    \n    F --&gt; G\n    \n    G --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; J\n\n    H --&gt; K\n    I --&gt; K\n    J --&gt; K\n\n    K --&gt; L\n    K --&gt; M\n\n    L --&gt; N\n    M --&gt; N\n    \n    N --&gt; O\n    O --&gt; P\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="StVO6y3aqgMxr9GMeZmF-1">
